    "review_text": "I have just completed a 12 hour paediactric first aid course with Eva (@andchillax) for the 4th time.\n\nI have returned each time to renew my paediactric first aid with Eva because  I have always had a good experience and the course has been delivered in an excellent manner.\n\nEva gives clear instrunctions with plenty of encouragement. The atmosphere is fairly relaxed but also purposeful. There is sufficient time to ask questions and get answers. Eva also provides examples to help clarify what we are learning.\n\nThere is also sufficient time to practice the skills we are learning.\n\nI would hightly recommend training with Eva to gain first aid knowledge and/or to complete one of her first aid courses.",
