    "review_text": "Six years ago I did a baby massage class with and chillax and it was amazing, my baby responded so well to it. Having a baby at the start of the year, and then entering lockdown I was so upset that I wouldn't be able to offer child 2 the same experiences as number 1 had. However, I then found out that And Chillax were doing online baby massage courses. These have literally saved me. Eva, the instructor guides us all through each step and corrects us if need be. The class sizes are just as they would be in normal day life, which I was also pleased about as I know some have larger groups meaning it's hard for the instructor to check if the movements are correct.\nMy little one calmed down a lot on this course, and she continues to love her time when we practice it after bath time, using the handouts that are posted.\nI'm so pleased I was able to do this class with my baby, it was also helpful that being at home if baby cried, or if I wanted relaxing music in the background it didn't matter as everyone on mute, using the hand symbol if we needed anything.\nI would definitely recommend this online massage course, it really did save me by asking baby feel more comfortable. Thank you.",
